_position": 50}, {"artist": "Tainy", "streams": 6692, "best_position": 55}]}, "pop": {"genre": "pop", "country_code": "hn", "country_name": "Honduras", "summary": "Pop music is a broad-term for many different types of music: The term is flexible, and the music labeled \"pop\" changes frequently. It usually refers to popular, appealing and mostly mainstream music with emphasis on catchy melodies and an accessible style, with songs that tend to have a short to medium length. Some subgenres may include synthpop, electropop, bubblegum, sophisti-pop, hyperpop and many others.", "url": null, "artists": [{"artist": "KAROL G", "streams": 43522, "best_position": 1}, {"artist": "Romeo Santos", "streams": 25709, "best_position": 40}, {"artist": "Maluma", "streams": 13152, "best_position": 56}, {"artist": "J Balvin", "streams": 10772, "best_position": 8}, {"artist": "BTS", "streams": 10713, "best_position": 9}, {"artist": "Tainy", "streams": 6692, "best_position": 55}, {"artist": "Junior H", "streams": 6074, "best_position": 78}, {"artist": "Man\u00e1", "streams": 5967, "best_position": 80}, {"artist": "A$AP Rocky", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "ABBA", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "AD\u00c9LA", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Alvaro Diaz", "streams": null, "best_position": null}]}, "post-punk": {"genre": "post-punk", "country_code": "hn", "country_name": "Honduras", "summary": "Post-punk (originally called new musick) is a broad genre of music that emerged in late 1977 in the wake of punk rock. Post-punk musicians departed from punk's fundamental elements and raw simplicity, instead adopting a broader, more experimental approach that encompassed a variety of avant-garde sensibilities and non-rock influences. Inspired by punk's energy and do it yourself ethic but determined to break from rock cliches, artists experimented with styles like funk.", "url": null, "artists": [{"artist": "Arctic Monkeys", "streams": nu